# Google Maps Platform API Key (Public client-side key read via $env/dynamic/public)
#
# Quickstart — Free Maps Demo Key (no billing or Cloud project required for prototyping):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
# 3. Generate and copy your demo key, then paste it below into a local `.env` file.
#    Note: The Maps Demo Key has a daily reset quota and is for prototyping only.
#
# Production Setup:
# Enable Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, and Geocoding API in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Always restrict production keys by HTTP referrer and enabled APIs:
# https://developers.google.com/maps/api-security-best-practices?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0

PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
